Perun
Copyright 2026 lazyeel (https://github.com/lazyeel)

This product includes software developed by lazyeel:
- Native x86_64 PE32+ image loader and binary projection runtime (perun-core)
- Win32 API to POSIX translation matrix / shim layer (perun-shims)
- Command-line runner and image inspector (perun-cli)
- C reference prototype of the loader and shim layer (prototype/)
